## react-native-body-highlighter

The anatomical path data in `web/src/lib/athletics/body-paths.ts` is derived from the SVG
geometry of **react-native-body-highlighter**, v3.2.0 (commit
`15df9e2dbc621450001960bed5a30e6a75357faa`), by ELABBASSI Hicham —
https://github.com/HichamELBSI/react-native-body-highlighter

Only the path geometry is used, remapped to this project's muscle vocabulary. None of the
upstream's code is included; five regions in that file (front `lats` and `hip flexors`, back
`back`, `rotator cuff` and `abductors`) are original additions, marked as such in the file.

